        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Nikhil Nanda, Ritu Nanda, Rajan Nanda, Raj Kapoor\n- Companies: Escorts Group\n- Products: Rajdoot Excel-T\n- Roles: insurance advisor, insurance agent, industrialist, Chairman and Managing Director, Managing Director, actor-filmmaker\n- Topics: Kapoor family, life insurance business\n\nFacts:\n- Ritu Nanda was born as Ritu Kapoor on 30 October 1948.\n- Ritu Nanda is a prominent insurance advisor associated chiefly with the life insurance business.\n- Nikhil Nanda is part of the Kapoor family.\n- Nikhil Nanda is the son of insurance agent Ritu Nanda and industrialist Rajan Nanda.\n- Nikhil Nanda is the grandson of actor-filmmaker Raj Kapoor.\n- Escorts Group’s management team includes Rajan Nanda as Chairman and Managing Director.\n- Escorts Group’s management team includes Nikhil Nanda as Managing Director.\n- The Rajdoot Excel-T is a 173 cc two-stroke motorcycle made in India by Escorts Group.",
